# Scene1-1-24

; ========================================
; ●シーン1-1‐24
; [back 5]
; ========================================

; ========================================
; ＞『ラウンジ』を選択
; ========================================

; ========================================
; [bgm Bgm_005_001_Loop]
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:5_2
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_5_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:会客厅里有一个地方，<br>令艾玛非常非常地在意。|#0101Adv28_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyCamera Offset:8,0 Zoom:0.6 EasingTypeName:SmoothStep Duration:0.9 Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:"（挂在墙壁上的弩枪被人偷走了……<br>　究竟是谁，在什么时候偷走的……？）|#0101Adv28_Ema001|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛站在会客厅的墙壁前<br>思索着这个问题。|#0101Adv28_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这时，奈叶香进来了。|#0101Adv28_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyCamera Offset:0,0 Zoom:0 EasingTypeName:SmoothStep Duration:0.9 Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.9
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，奈叶香你好。<br>你也在调查案件吗？|#0101Adv28_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……你管我。|#0101Adv28_Nanoka001| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:听到奈叶香冷淡的回应，<br>汉娜有些生气地鼓起了嘴。|#0101Adv28_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:什么叫“你管我”，<br>现在可是死了人欸？你这是什么态度。|#0101Adv28_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0101Adv28_Nanoka002| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香并未投去冰冷的眼神，<br>可是汉娜却不禁后退了一步。|#0101Adv28_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:明明没有她身上感受到压迫感，明明没有感觉她可怕，<br>可汉娜却感觉有些后悔跟她讲话。|#0101Adv28_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那是一种不可言说的感觉，<br>就好像一旦触碰，就会吸入其中无法挣脱的，深渊般的感觉——|#0101Adv28_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:尽管在奈叶香身上感受到了这种感觉，<br>可艾玛还是下定了决心，发起提问。|#0101Adv28_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香，我有事问你，<br>你之前说有人偷了会客厅的弩枪，对吗？|#0101Adv28_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那又怎么了。|#0101Adv28_Nanoka003| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛被她用充满疑心的阴暗眼神盯着，<br>不禁吞了吞口水。|#0101Adv28_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:因为我看你一直很关心弩枪的问题。|#0101Adv28_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为了在这座监牢保命，武器是必需的。|#0101Adv28_Nanoka004| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:弩枪摆在那么明显的地方，<br>我想大家肯定都多少在意过这事。|#0101Adv28_Nanoka005| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:话讲完了？|#0101Adv28_Nanoka006| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香正打算离开，<br>而雪莉这时却拦住她的去路。|#0101Adv28_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:还有一件事要问你！<br>——你的魔法是什么？|#0101Adv28_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……没必要告诉你。|#0101Adv28_Nanoka007| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:别这样说嘛！<br>我超在意大家会用什么魔法的～！|#0101Adv28_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:不管雪莉怎样恳求，奈叶香都不愿意回答，<br>打算径直离开。|#0101Adv28_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香你也太可疑了，还一直当一匹孤狼。<br>最坏的情况下，你会被别人当作【魔女】哦？|#0101Adv28_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉脸上保持着微笑，<br>嘴上却说出了吓人的话。|#0101Adv28_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:雪、雪莉！？|#0101Adv28_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香止住了脚步。|#0101Adv28_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:当成魔女又怎样，随便你们。<br>——反正最后大家都会死。|#0101Adv28_Nanoka008| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（欸……？<br>　那是什么意思……？）|#0101Adv28_Ema005|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛转过头来，但已不见奈叶香的身影，<br>就好像刚刚的一切都是幻觉似的。|#0101Adv28_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

